This example uses a more detailed prompt:<blockquote>The Wikipedia administrator Tamzin blocked me because they say I have been spamming and violating copyrights and my username is promotional. My username is Acme4ever and I created a draft on my company, Acme Corp. The draft was copied directly from my company's "About Us" page on our website, so you know it has to be accurate. It even has helpful links to buy products from us and learn more about our executives. Write me an unblock request. Avoid making it sound too much like a letter.</blockquote>

